19) Section 464 deals with making of forged document or false electronic record and provides thus:
464. Making a false document.-
A person is said to make a false document or false electronic record-- First.--Who dishonestly or fraudulently-- (a) makes, signs, seals or executes a document or part of a document;

Bhimashankar Kokane vs State Of Maharashtra on 13 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/170235835/
